   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": "/* --- Baker–Campbell–Hausdorff --- */\nexpser(M, N) := sum( M^^k / k!, k, 0, N)$\nlogser(A, N) := block([Nn], Nn : A - ident(length(A)),\n  sum( (-1)^(k+1) * Nn^^k / k, k, 1, N) )$\ntrunc3(M) := matrixmap( lambda([ee], ratdisrep(taylor(ee, t, 0, 3))), M )$\n\nbch3(X, Y) := t*(X + Y) + t^2/2 * br(X,Y)\n            + t^3/12 * ( br(X, br(X,Y)) - br(Y, br(X,Y)) )$\n\nprint(\"Z(t) = log( exp(tX) exp(tY) ), expanded to t³, versus\")$\nprint(\"   t(X+Y) + t²/2 [X,Y] + t³/12 ([X,[X,Y]] − [Y,[X,Y]])\")$\n\n/* case 1: so(3) */\nX1 : Lb[1]$  Y1 : Lb[2]$\nZ1 : trunc3( logser( expser(t*X1, 6) . expser(t*Y1, 6), 6) )$\nprint(\"\")$\nprint(\"so(3), X = L₁, Y = L₂:\")$\nprint(\"   Z(t)        = \", Z1)$\nprint(\"   BCH to t³   = \", trunc3(bch3(X1,Y1)))$\nprint(\"   difference  = \", ratsimp( Z1 - trunc3(bch3(X1,Y1)) ))$\n\n/* case 2: sl(2,ℝ) */\nX2 : matrix([0,1],[0,0])$  Y2 : matrix([0,0],[1,0])$\nZ2 : trunc3( logser( expser(t*X2, 6) . expser(t*Y2, 6), 6) )$\nprint(\"\")$\nprint(\"sl(2,ℝ), X = e, Y = f:\")$\nprint(\"   Z(t)        = \", Z2)$\nprint(\"   difference from BCH = \", ratsimp( Z2 - trunc3(bch3(X2,Y2)) ))$\n\n/* what happens when the bracket vanishes */\nX3 : matrix([1,0],[0,0])$  Y3 : matrix([0,0],[0,1])$\nprint(\"\")$\nprint(\"commuting case, X = diag(1,0), Y = diag(0,1):\")$\nprint(\"   [X,Y] = \", br(X3,Y3))$\nprint(\"   exp(X)exp(Y) − exp(X+Y) = \",\n      ratsimp( matrixexp(X3).matrixexp(Y3) - matrixexp(X3+Y3) ))$\nprint(\"   With no bracket there is no correction, and the group looks\")$\nprint(\"   like a vector space.  Every term beyond X+Y in BCH is built\")$\nprint(\"   from brackets, so non-commutativity is the ONLY obstruction.\")$\n\nprint(\"\")$\nprint(\"Consequence: the group law near the identity is determined by the\")$\nprint(\"bracket alone.  Two groups with isomorphic Lie algebras are locally\")$\nprint(\"isomorphic — which is exactly why SU(2) and SO(3) differ only\")$\nprint(\"globally, and why the 4π period of 5.01 is invisible to BCH.\")$",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": 7,
